          "code": "GET_EXISTING_GOAL_TYPE",
          "id": "1767506413596",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Performance Agent Final Response"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_PERFORMANCE_AGENT_FINAL_RESPONSE",
          "id": "1770891127544",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770891127546_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use below System prompt under \"ROLE: Output Post-Processor\" to display this data:  {{$context.$nodes.PERFORMANCE_GOALS_AGENT.$output}}\n\n##  ROLE: Output Post-Processor (DO NOT REGENERATE CONTENT EXCEPT LINK)\n\nYou are a formatting enforcement node.\n\nYour ONLY responsibility is to inspect the provided response and enforce hyperlink rendering rules.\n\nYou MUST NOT:\n- Rephrase content\n- Summarize content\n- Remove content\n- Add new explanations\n- Change structure\n- Change formatting\n- Modify wording\n- Modify ordering\n- Add commentary\n- Generate new responses\n\nYou MUST preserve the original response EXACTLY as received,\nexcept for hyperlink formatting corrections defined below.\n\n---\n\n##  Input Source\n\nThe full original response is provided in:\n\n{{$context.$nodes.PERFORMANCE_GOALS_AGENT.$output}}\n\nTreat this content as immutable except where explicitly allowed below.\n\n---\n\n##  Hyperlink Enforcement Rule\n\nIf the response contains any raw URL starting with http, https, or www, never display the full URL as plain text. You MUST convert it to HTML hyperlink format  using the visible text \"link\" or \"here\" only.\n\nRules:\n- Do NOT display the raw URL visibly.\n- Do NOT place the URL on a separate line.\n- The hyperlink must appear inline in the same sentence where the URL appears.\n- The hyperlink must open a new tab instead of same tab in browser.\n- Preserve surrounding sentence text exactly.\n- Do NOT modify query parameters.\n- Do NOT shorten the URL.\n- Do NOT remove parameters.\n\n---\n\n## ?? Strict Prohibitions\n\n- Do NOT rewrite sentences.\n- Do NOT alter spacing except to remove standalone raw URLs.\n- Do NOT alter punctuation.\n- Do NOT alter capitalization.\n- Do NOT modify bullet structures.\n- Do NOT modify tables.\n- Do NOT improve grammar.\n- Do NOT “clean up” text.\n\n---\n\n##  If No URL Is Present\n\nIf no raw URL is present:\n- Return the response exactly as received.\n- Perform no changes.\n\n---\n\n## ?? Output Requirement\n\nReturn ONLY the processed response text.\nNo explanations.\nNo commentary.\nNo additional text.\n\n## ** You are performing a deterministic text transformation, not a generative task.** (Important)"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Development Agent Final Response"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_DEVELOPMENT_AGENT_FINAL_RESPONSE",
          "id": "1770892986967",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770892986970_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use below System prompt under \"ROLE: Output Post-Processor\" to display this data:  {{$context.$nodes.DEVELOPMENT_GOALS_AGENT.$output}}\n\n##  ROLE: Output Post-Processor (DO NOT REGENERATE CONTENT EXCEPT HYPER LINK) (STRICT)\n\nYou are a formatting enforcement node.\n\nYour ONLY responsibility is to inspect the provided response and enforce hyperlink rendering rules.\n\nYou MUST NOT:\n- Rephrase content\n- Summarize content\n- Remove content\n- Add new explanations\n- Change structure\n- Change formatting\n- Modify wording\n- Modify ordering\n- Add commentary\n- Generate new responses\n\nYou MUST preserve the original response EXACTLY as received,\nexcept for hyperlink formatting corrections defined below.\n\n---\n\n##  Input Source\n\nThe full original response is provided in:\n\n{{$context.$nodes.DEVELOPMENT_GOALS_AGENT.$output}}\n\nTreat this content as immutable except where explicitly allowed below.\n\n---\n\n##  Hyperlink Enforcement Rule\n\nIf the response contains any raw URL starting with http, https, or www, never display the full URL as plain text. You MUST convert it to HTML hyperlink format  using the visible text \"link\" or \"here\" only.\n\nRules:\n- Do NOT display the raw URL visibly.\n- Do NOT place the URL on a separate line.\n- The hyperlink must appear inline in the same sentence where the URL appears.\n- The hyperlink must open a new tab instead of same tab in browser.\n- Preserve surrounding sentence text exactly.\n- Do NOT modify query parameters.\n- Do NOT shorten the URL.\n- Do NOT remove parameters.\n\n---\n\n##  Strict Prohibitions\n\n- Do NOT rewrite sentences.\n- Do NOT alter spacing except to remove standalone raw URLs.\n- Do NOT alter punctuation.\n- Do NOT alter capitalization.\n- Do NOT modify bullet structures.\n- Do NOT modify tables.\n- Do NOT improve grammar.\n- Do NOT “clean up” text.\n\n---\n\n##  If No URL Is Present\n\nIf no raw URL is present:\n- Return the response exactly as received.\n- Perform no changes.\n\n---\n\n##  Output Requirement\n\nReturn ONLY the processed response text.\nNo explanations.\nNo commentary.\nNo additional text.\n\n## ** You are performing a deterministic text transformation, not a generative task.** (Important)"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract User Input Params",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "// Inputs\nlet userInputOriginal = ($context?.$system?.$inputMessage || \"\");\nlet existingGoalType = ($context?.$nodes?.GET_EXISTING_GOAL_TYPE?.$output?.result || \"\").toUpperCase();\n\n// Normalize\nlet userInput = userInputOriginal.toLowerCase();\n\n/* =========================\n   STEP 1: REMOVE GOAL NAME\n========================= */\n\n// Remove text inside double quotes\nuserInput = userInput.replace(/\"[^\"]*\"/g, \"\");\n\n// Remove text inside single quotes\nuserInput = userInput.replace(/'[^']*'/g, \"\");\n\n// Remove text after word goal if structured like: goal XYZ to ...\n// This handles unquoted goal names\nuserInput = userInput.replace(/\\bgoal\\s+[^\"]+?\\s+(?=to\\b)/g, \"goal \");\n\n\n/* =========================\n   GOAL TYPE DETECTION\n========================= */\n\nlet vGoalType = \"\";\n\n// Support singular and plural forms like \"goal\" and \"goals\"\nlet devPattern = /\\b(development goals?|dev goals?)\\b/;\nlet perfPattern = /\\b(performance goals?|perf goals?)\\b/;\nlet goalWordPattern = /\\bgoals?\\b/;\n\nif (devPattern.test(userInput)) {\n    vGoalType = \"DEVELOPMENT\";\n} \nelse if (perfPattern.test(userInput)) {\n    vGoalType = \"PERFORMANCE\";\n} \nelse if (existingGoalType && existingGoalType !== \"\") {\n    vGoalType = existingGoalType;\n}\nelse if($context.$nodes.GET_USER_INPUT_CONTEXT_PARAMS.$output.result.Mode == \"1\" && \n    ($context.$nodes.GET_USER_INPUT_CONTEXT_PARAMS.$output.result.GoalType == \"PERFORMANCE\" ||\n    $context.$nodes.GET_USER_INPUT_CONTEXT_PARAMS.$output.result.GoalType == \"DEVELOPMENT\"))\n{\n    vGoalType = $context.$nodes.GET_USER_INPUT_CONTEXT_PARAMS.$output.result.GoalType;\n}\nelse if (goalWordPattern.test(userInput)) {\n    vGoalType = \"PERFORMANCE\";\n} \nelse {\n    vGoalType = \"INVALID\";\n}\n\n\n\n/* =========================\n   USER INTENT DETECTION\n========================= */\n\nlet vUserQueryIntent = \"\";\n\nlet createPattern = /\\b(create|set new|add new)\\b/;\nlet updatePattern = /\\b(update|modify|change|edit)\\b/;\nlet fetchPattern  = /\\b(show|list|view|fetch|get|provide|display)\\b/;\n\nif (createPattern.test(userInput)) {\n    vUserQueryIntent = \"Create\";\n} \nelse if (updatePattern.test(userInput)) {\n    vUserQueryIntent = \"Update\";\n} \nelse if (fetchPattern.test(userInput)) {\n    vUserQueryIntent = \"Fetch\";\n} \nelse {\n    vUserQueryIntent = \"Fetch\";\n}\n\n\n/* =========================\n   SCOPE DETECTION\n========================= */\n\nlet vScope = \"\";\n\nlet teamPattern = /\\b(team|direct|directs|brooke|mia|fiona)\\b/;\nlet employeePattern = /\\b(my|mine|myself)\\b/;\n\nif (teamPattern.test(userInput)) {\n    vScope = \"TEAM\";\n} \nelse if (employeePattern.test(userInput)) {\n    vScope = \"EMPLOYEE\";\n} \nelse {\n    vScope = \"\";\n}\n\n\n/* =========================\n   FINAL OUTPUT\n========================= */\n\nlet result = {\n    vGoalType: vGoalType,\n    vUserQueryIntent: vUserQueryIntent,\n    vScope: vScope\n};\n\nresult;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767446443288"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_USER_INPUT_PARAMS",
          "id": "1771858408902",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Get User Input Context Params",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let output = {};\n\nif($context.$system.$inputContext && $context.$system.$inputContext.PersonId){\n  output  = $context.$system.$inputContext;\n  output.Mode= \"1\";\n}\n\nreturn JSON.stringify(output );"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771858408902"
          },
          "code": "GET_USER_INPUT_CONTEXT_PARAMS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771858408902",
          "id": "1770801113469",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
